{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And she opened and saw him.</b> Who he is — for she saw the child and did not yet know whether it was male or female, since the word ילד is ambiguous. After she looked at him, she saw, and behold, a youth was weeping. Another interpretation: <b>and behold, a youth was weeping</b> — she saw Aaron weeping, for he was his brother; therefore 'and she said, one of the Hebrew children is this.' Our Sages said: it calls him ילד and it calls him נער, which teaches that his mother made him a youth's canopy in the ark."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:46.969587071Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}